/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed: this workspace ships a binary (`rtiexec`),
# and a committed lockfile is required for reproducible CI builds with
# `--locked`. Per the Cargo book guidance for end-product binaries.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
# Test artifacts: federation save snapshots are written to a relative
# `hla4-saves/` directory when a test runs with CWD inside a crate.
**/hla4-saves/
